---
Show one methodology by ID

Usage: vendo measurement methodologies get [OPTIONS] <methodologyId>

Arguments:
  <methodologyId>  

Options:
      --json  Output raw JSON
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement methodologies get <methodologyId>
  $ vendo measurement methodologies get <methodologyId> --json
